# The image takes only what the Dockerfile COPYs (package.json,
# backend/package.json, backend/src, src/engine). This file keeps secrets,
# dependencies, build output, local tool state, logs and test-only code out
# of the build context. Plain exclusions only - never a "!" re-include:
# Render's context filter does not re-enter an excluded directory.
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
**/node_modules
dist
.claude
.vercel
.fly
.railway
**/*.log
**/verify.ts
src/engine/testing
